        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a car from Delhi to Madurai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The door‑to‑door Car Transport From Delhi To Madurai usually takes 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic conditions along the NH 19 corridor and any unforeseen weather events. Our enclosed carrier follows a pre‑planned route with live GPS monitoring to ensure timely delivery while maintaining the zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken to prevent scratches or damage during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a four‑point safety protocol: a joint pre‑load inspection, hydraulic ramp loading with anti‑slip mats, 4‑wheel lock securing, and edge padding using our 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging. All vehicles travel in sealed, climate‑controlled carriers, and our drivers are trained in gentle handling to guarantee a scratch‑free arrival.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are required for RTO registration when moving a car from Delhi to Madurai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You must provide the original Registration Certificate, insurance policy, a valid Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate, a signed e‑Way bill, and a GST invoice from our services. Our team also assists with the No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) and helps complete the state‑specific transfer forms to streamline the RTO process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the car transport service, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment includes IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % of the declared vehicle value. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities during the Delhi‑Madurai journey. Optional higher‑value coverage can be added upon request for extra peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it is being transported?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our GPS‑enabled carriers broadcast live location updates to a secure customer portal, allowing you to view the exact position of your car at any moment. You also receive automated SMS alerts at key milestones, and our support team is available 24/7 to answer any queries.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the cost of car transport from Delhi to Madurai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is driven by distance (≈850 km), vehicle size and weight, type of carrier (enclosed vs open), fuel surcharge, insurance coverage, and any additional services such as door‑to‑door pickup, extra padding for fragile items, or expedited delivery. Our transparent cost table breaks down each component for full clarity.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on the types or sizes of vehicles you can transport on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We handle most passenger cars, SUVs, and light commercial vehicles up to 2.5 tons. Oversized or heavily modified vehicles may require a customized carrier and additional permits. Our team evaluates each request and advises on the best solution, ensuring compliance with highway regulations and safety standards.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
